<div id="content_area">
	<div class="wrap content-columns">
		<div id="post-30" class="post_box top type-page status-publish">
			<div class="headline_area">
			</div>
			<div class="post_content">
<p>XLerateHealth offers an <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.xleratehealth.com/accelerator/curriculum/">intensive 10-week training course</a> that connects your startup to world-class <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.xleratehealth.com/mentors/">Mentors</a> and leading health and wellness companies in the United States. Participants in the program will have continued exposure to potential customers and funders, as well as thought-leaders in the transformation of the health delivery system. These Mentors are the backbone of our program and offer a network that can dramatically impact the trajectory of your business. The program is a combination of classroom time, scheduled one-on-one sessions with Mentors, and focused customer discovery.</p>
<h3><a name="dates"></a><span style="color: #ff9900;">Important Program Dates</span></h3>
<div class="threecol-one"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Pencil-70px.png"><img class="size-full wp-image-974 alignleft" alt="Pencil Icon" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100im_/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Pencil-70px.png" width="70" height="70"/></a></p>
<h3>Applications Due</h3>
<p>June 17, 2013</div>
<div class="threecol-one"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Tasks-70px.png"><img class="size-full wp-image-975 alignleft" alt="Checklist Icon" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100im_/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Tasks-70px.png" width="70" height="70"/></a></p>
<h3>Program Starts</h3>
<p>Aug 12, 2013</div>
<div class="threecol-one last"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Goal-70px.png"><img class="size-full wp-image-976 alignleft" alt="Goal Icon" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100im_/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Goal-70px.png" width="70" height="70"/></a></p>
<h3>Demo Day</h3>
<p>Oct 25, 2013</div><div class="clear"></div>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">Why Your Startup Should Apply to XLerateHealth</span></h3>
<p>There are a lot of great accelerators out there, including a select number that focus on health and wellness. We believe that XLerateHealth&#8217;s Mentor base, our access to customers and pilot sites, and our extensive experience in building successful startups makes our program a leader among healthcare accelerators. You should apply to XLerateHealth because our focus is on getting you face to face with customers as quickly as possible. You will leave this program with much more than a pitch deck; you’ll leave XLerateHealth with a viable business.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">What We&#8217;re Looking For</span></h3>
<p>We are looking for dynamic teams of entrepreneurs who are passionate about what they do and are interested in creating disruptive solutions to tough problems in the healthcare ecosystem. We prefer teams that include founders with technical ability, a knowledge of the healthcare industry, and who are intent on succeeding as scaleable commercial enterprises.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">Application Process and Requirements</span></h3>
<p>We will start with an <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.xleratehealth.com/applynow/">online application</a>. From there we will select companies we would like to participate in a web conference. We then will have an in-person interview as the final step. We will work through this process quickly and welcome questions at any point. The only requirement is that the majority of your team be present in Louisville for the duration of the program.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">What Selected Teams Get </span></h3>
<ul>
<li dir="ltr">A $20,000 stipend</li>
<li dir="ltr">Support from XLerateHealth&#8217;s <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.xleratehealth.com/mentors/">Mentor</a> network, as well as introductions and meetings with pilot customers, potential funders and potential acquirers.</li>
<li dir="ltr">Free office space in the heart of Louisville’s downtown within walking distance to the NuLu district’s bars, coffee shops, restaurants and meeting/co-working spaces.</li>
<li dir="ltr">Over $50,000 in donated professional services
<ul>
<li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.peak10.com/" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.peak10.com']);"><strong>Peak 10</strong></a> | 12 months of cloud hosting and technology services | <em>Approximate value: <strong>$24,000</strong></em></li>
<li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.frostbrowntodd.com/" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.frostbrowntodd.com']);"><strong>Frost Brown Todd</strong></a> | Legal advice, company creation services and deferral of fees until closing of financing | <em>Approximate value: <strong>$10,000</strong></em></li>
<li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://boxcarpr.com/" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://boxcarpr.com']);"><strong>Boxcar PR</strong></a> / <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.perituspr.com/" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.perituspr.com']);"><strong>Peritus PR</strong></a> | Free messaging and positioning strategy session, strategic communications plan and one free news release | <em>Approximate value: <strong>$5,000</strong></em></li>
<li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.juddcpa.com/" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://www.juddcpa.com']);"><strong>Judd &amp; Judd, PLLC</strong></a> | Free accounting and tax advisory services | <em>Approximate value: <strong>$5,000</strong></em></li>
<li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://katiebushdesign.com/" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://katiebushdesign.com']);"><strong>Katie Bush Design</strong></a> | Free design and branding consultation | <em>Approximate value: <strong>$5,000</strong></em></li>
<li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://integrityhr.com/" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20130805100100/http://integrityhr.com']);"><strong>Integrity HR</strong></a> | Free human resources consulting services and forms | <em>Approximate value: <strong>$600</strong></em></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">What XLerateHealth Gets</span></h3>
<p>In exchange for the funding, support and Mentorship, XLerateHealth receives a 6% equity stake in your company. If you do not require the $20,000 stipend, your company may participate in the accelerator program in exchange for a significantly smaller equity stake. Like the founders, XLerateHealth receives common stock.</p>
